{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Every PostHog feature flag planted in this fixture, its intended state in PostHog, where it is referenced in code, and the verdict a stale-flag audit is expected to reach. scripts/seed-posthog.mjs applies the posthog block, including one $feature_flag_called event at firstCalledDaysAgo and one at lastCalledDaysAgo so flag age and recency are both testable; scripts/verify-report.mjs checks a report against the expected block.",
